<section class="guide-grid"><article><i data-lucide="database"></i><h2>What we save</h2><ul><li>Your name, username, age, and a protected password hash.</li><li>Your classes, tasks, groups, comments, resources, reports, and notifications.</li><li>A session cookie while you are signed in.</li></ul></article><article><i data-lucide="eye-off"></i><h2>What we do not do today</h2><ul><li>We do not collect email addresses.</li><li>We do not run Google Analytics.</li><li>We do not sell student data or show ads.</li></ul></article><article><i data-lucide="shield-check"></i><h2>How we keep things safer</h2><ul><li>Content is checked by local and, when enabled, outside safety tools.</li><li>People can report content to group moderators.</li><li>Moderators may remove content or suspend accounts.</li></ul></article><article><i data-lucide="users"></i><h2>What others can see</h2><ul><li>Group members can see content shared in their group.</li><li>Admins and moderators can review reports and moderation history.</li><li>Shared links are not private secrets.</li></ul></article></section>
<section class="guide-rules"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SIDE OF THE DEAL</p><h2>Use the room like other people are in it.</h2></div><ul class="check-list"><li><i data-lucide="check"></i> Be honest about who you are.</li><li><i data-lucide="check"></i> Do not harass, threaten, exploit, or target people.</li><li><i data-lucide="check"></i> Do not post illegal, harmful, private, or copyrighted material you cannot share.</li><li><i data-lucide="check"></i> Keep passwords and sensitive personal details out of posts.</li></ul></section>
